<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type" />
    <%= stylesheet_link_tag "mailer" %>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Review your latest notes</h1>

      <p>You have <%= pluralize(@notes.count, "note") %> due Today.</p>
      <%= link_to("Review them here", "#{ENV.fetch("APP_URL")}review-notes") %>

      <div>
        <blockquote cite="https://www.huxley.net/bnw/four.html">
          <p>
            Words can be like X-rays, if you use them properly—they'll go through
            anything. You read and you're pierced.
          </p>
        </blockquote>
        <p>—Aldous Huxley, <cite>Brave New World</cite></p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        Keep learning, one step at a time💡
        <br>
        <a href=<%= ENV.fetch("APP_URL") %> class="button">Jump back into your notes</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>